{
    "_comment": "The Gardener (gardener_hut). Old, kind, slow; talks to the plants. He is the one who brings flowers to the stone rows. Quest 'gardener' in stages: (1) 3 Glowing Sprouts - 2 on the floor of far parts of the Garden, 1 from a toxic flower (25%), only during the quest; (2) water from the very end of the sunken pier (pier_water); (3) back to him -> map of the Garden + Toxic Gas.",
    "partner": "gardener",
    "start": [
        {
            "if": {
                "quest_done": "gardener"
            },
            "goto": "after"
        },
        {
            "if": {
                "quest_step": [
                    "gardener",
                    "return"
                ]
            },
            "goto": "watered"
        },
        {
            "if": {
                "quest_step": [
                    "gardener",
                    "water"
                ]
            },
            "goto": "wait_water"
        },
        {
            "if": {
                "quest": "gardener",
                "item_count": [
                    "Glowing Sprout",
                    3
                ]
            },
            "goto": "sprouts_in"
        },
        {
            "if": {
                "quest": "gardener"
            },
            "goto": "wait_sprouts"
        },
        {
            "if": {
                "flag": "talked:gardener"
            },
            "goto": "again"
        },
        "first"
    ],
    "nodes": {
        "first": {
            "do": {
                "flag": "talked:gardener"
            },
            "lines": [
                {
                    "id": "gardener_01",
                    "who": "gardener",
                    "pose": "whisper",
                    "text": "Shh... she's sleeping."
                },
                {
                    "id": "gardener_02",
                    "who": "gardener",
                    "pose": "smile",
                    "text": "Oh. A visitor. Mind the moss, it bruises."
                },
                {
                    "id": "gardener_03",
                    "who": "gardener",
                    "pose": "calm",
                    "text": "I'm the gardener. Just the gardener. Everybody forgot my name a long time ago, and I let them."
                },
                {
                    "who": "player",
                    "pose": "neutral",
                    "text": "How long have you been down here?"
                },
                {
                    "id": "gardener_04",
                    "who": "gardener",
                    "pose": "thinking",
                    "text": "Since the garden came down. Or since I came down with it. I don't remember which came first."
                },
                {
                    "id": "gardener_05",
                    "who": "gardener",
                    "pose": "smile",
                    "text": "The plants remember, I think. Plants remember everything. They just don't talk about it."
                },
                {
                    "id": "gardener_06",
                    "who": "gardener",
                    "pose": "calm",
                    "text": "...Would you help an old man? My hands aren't what they were."
                },
                {
                    "id": "gardener_07",
                    "who": "gardener",
                    "pose": "pointing",
                    "text": "There are sprouts that glow. Real ones, from before. Two of them grow far from here, where nobody walks."
                },
                {
                    "id": "gardener_08",
                    "who": "gardener",
                    "pose": "tired",
                    "text": "And the toxic flowers... one of them swallowed a sprout. Greedy thing. You'll have to take it back."
                },
                {
                    "id": "gardener_09",
                    "who": "gardener",
                    "pose": "smile",
                    "text": "Bring me all three, and I'll show you something."
                }
            ],
            "choices": [
                {
                    "text": "I'll find them.",
                    "goto": "accept"
                },
                {
                    "text": "Who brings flowers to the stone rows?",
                    "goto": "stones"
                },
                {
                    "text": "Not now.",
                    "goto": "no"
                }
            ]
        },
        "again": {
            "random_line": true,
            "lines": [
                {
                    "id": "gardener_10",
                    "who": "gardener",
                    "pose": "smile",
                    "text": "Back again? The moss remembers you."
                },
                {
                    "id": "gardener_11",
                    "who": "gardener",
                    "pose": "calm",
                    "text": "Mind your step. Everything here is older than it looks."
                }
            ],
            "choices": [
                {
                    "text": "I'll find them.",
                    "goto": "accept"
                },
                {
                    "text": "Who brings flowers to the stone rows?",
                    "goto": "stones"
                },
                {
                    "text": "Not now.",
                    "goto": "no"
                }
            ]
        },
        "stones": {
            "lines": [
                {
                    "id": "gardener_12",
                    "who": "gardener",
                    "pose": "sad",
                    "text": "...I do."
                },
                {
                    "id": "gardener_13",
                    "who": "gardener",
                    "pose": "calm",
                    "text": "Every morning. Or what I call morning, down here."
                },
                {
                    "id": "gardener_14",
                    "who": "gardener",
                    "pose": "sad",
                    "text": "Somebody should remember them. The plants can't carry flowers."
                },
                {
                    "id": "gardener_15",
                    "who": "gardener",
                    "pose": "calm",
                    "text": "So. Will you help me with the sprouts?"
                }
            ],
            "choices": [
                {
                    "text": "I'll find them.",
                    "goto": "accept"
                },
                {
                    "text": "Not now.",
                    "goto": "no"
                }
            ]
        },
        "no": {
            "lines": [
                {
                    "id": "gardener_16",
                    "who": "gardener",
                    "pose": "smile",
                    "text": "No hurry. Nothing down here is in a hurry."
                }
            ]
        },
        "accept": {
            "do": {
                "quest": {
                    "start": "gardener"
                }
            },
            "lines": [
                {
                    "id": "gardener_17",
                    "who": "gardener",
                    "pose": "smile",
                    "text": "Thank you. Far corners, where nobody walks - that's where they like it."
                },
                {
                    "id": "gardener_18",
                    "who": "gardener",
                    "pose": "serious",
                    "text": "And the toxic flower... be careful. They bite."
                }
            ]
        },
        "wait_sprouts": {
            "random_line": true,
            "lines": [
                {
                    "id": "gardener_19",
                    "who": "gardener",
                    "pose": "calm",
                    "text": "Far corners, where nobody walks. And mind the toxic flowers."
                },
                {
                    "id": "gardener_20",
                    "who": "gardener",
                    "pose": "smile",
                    "text": "They glow, you can't miss them. Unless you're not looking. Most people aren't."
                },
                {
                    "id": "gardener_21",
                    "who": "gardener",
                    "pose": "calm",
                    "text": "One, two, three. I'll wait. I'm good at waiting."
                }
            ]
        },
        "sprouts_in": {
            "lines": [
                {
                    "id": "gardener_22",
                    "who": "gardener",
                    "pose": "happy",
                    "text": "All three. Look at them glow..."
                },
                {
                    "id": "gardener_23",
                    "who": "gardener",
                    "pose": "thinking",
                    "text": "But they're thirsty. Down here the water is all wrong - except at the end of the old pier."
                },
                {
                    "id": "gardener_24",
                    "who": "gardener",
                    "pose": "pointing",
                    "text": "The lake there is clean. Cold, but clean. Take my watering can and fill it at the very end."
                }
            ],
            "do": {
                "take": [
                    "Glowing Sprout",
                    "Glowing Sprout",
                    "Glowing Sprout"
                ],
                "quest": {
                    "step": [
                        "gardener",
                        "water"
                    ]
                }
            }
        },
        "wait_water": {
            "lines": [
                {
                    "id": "gardener_25",
                    "who": "gardener",
                    "pose": "pointing",
                    "text": "The pier. The very end. The water is cleaner where nobody stands."
                }
            ]
        },
        "watered": {
            "lines": [
                {
                    "id": "gardener_26",
                    "who": "gardener",
                    "pose": "happy",
                    "text": "You've got it? Give it here, give it here..."
                },
                {
                    "id": "gardener_27",
                    "who": "gardener",
                    "pose": "whisper",
                    "text": "There we go. Drink, little ones."
                },
                {
                    "id": "gardener_28",
                    "who": "gardener",
                    "pose": "happy",
                    "text": "...See that? They glow brighter already."
                },
                {
                    "id": "gardener_29",
                    "who": "gardener",
                    "pose": "smile",
                    "text": "You've done more for this garden than anybody in years."
                },
                {
                    "id": "gardener_30",
                    "who": "gardener",
                    "pose": "pointing",
                    "text": "Here. A map of the garden, the way I know it. Every corner, every root."
                },
                {
                    "id": "gardener_31",
                    "who": "gardener",
                    "pose": "grin",
                    "text": "And this - I bottled it from the toxic flowers. Nasty stuff. Whatever you shoot, it keeps stinging. And stinging."
                }
            ],
            "then": "reward"
        },
        "reward": {
            "do": {
                "reveal_map": "cellar:garden",
                "give": "Toxic Gas",
                "quest": {
                    "finish": "gardener"
                }
            },
            "lines": [
                {
                    "id": "gardener_32",
                    "who": "gardener",
                    "pose": "smile",
                    "text": "Don't open it indoors."
                }
            ]
        },
        "after": {
            "random_line": true,
            "lines": [
                {
                    "id": "gardener_33",
                    "who": "gardener",
                    "pose": "smile",
                    "text": "They're growing. Slowly. Everything down here grows slowly."
                },
                {
                    "id": "gardener_34",
                    "who": "gardener",
                    "pose": "calm",
                    "text": "Every morning the stones, every evening the sprouts. It's a quiet life. A good one."
                },
                {
                    "id": "gardener_35",
                    "who": "gardener",
                    "pose": "smile",
                    "text": "Mind the toxic flowers. And thank you."
                }
            ]
        }
    }
}
